  "integrationNotes": "Freelance Writing & Copywriting is a core \u20a60 skill-based hustle. Primary platforms for Nigerians: Fiverr, Upwork, direct WhatsApp/LinkedIn outreach to local businesses, Contently-style, and Nigerian content agencies. Dollar clients via Payoneer/Grey/Wise. Start with portfolio samples (even self-written). High demand niches: SEO blog posts, product descriptions, email sequences, social captions, sales pages. Realistic beginner rates \u20a65k\u2013\u20a625k per article locally; $15\u2013$80+ for international once reviews exist.",
